# Forget Me Not (WotG 42) not current (Her Memories current, a Status 2 var): the login in Batallia Downs completes
# nothing; the Cavernous Maw plays its own script's event 500 (xi.maws.onTrigger), whose finish changes nothing.
lists BatalliaDowns/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger BatalliaDowns/onEventFinish/4
char zone=BatalliaDowns pos=-48,0.1,435 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg HerMemories current
charvar Mission[5][41]Status 2
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw
finish-if-event
